  description: 'V5 (visual prefabs): 0:00, no weapons, a quiet sea: XP gems, gold
    coins, a gold barrel, an XP barrel and a health barrel on the water, and four
    floor powerups (Repair Supplies, Battle Signal, Tailwind, Salvage Chime) around
    the ship (visuals_powerups has the other four: a run holds six at once). Every
    visual is a prefab under Assets/_Game/V4/Visuals/Prefabs/<Category>/<id>/ (plan/v5/VISUAL-PREFABS.md):
    edit one, then load this again from the Tuning Console.'
